#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"</AccordionItem>\n"
"</Accordion>\n"
"Quantum workflows often take a while to complete and can run over many sessions. Restarting your Python kernel means you'll lose any results stored in memory. To avoid loss of data, you can save results to file and retrieve results of past jobs from IBM Quantum&reg; so your next session can continue where you left off.\n"
msgstr ""
"</AccordionItem>\n"
"</Accordion>\n"
"Ang mga quantum workflow ay madalas na tumatagal bago matapos at maaaring tumaas sa maraming session. Ang pag-restart ng iyong Python kernel ay nangangahulugang mawawala ang lahat ng mga resulta na naka-imbak sa memorya. Para maiwasan ang pagkawala ng data, maaari kang mag-save ng mga resulta sa file at i-retrieve ang mga resulta ng mga nakaraang job mula sa IBM Quantum&reg; para matuloy ng iyong susunod na session kung saan ka natigil.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Retrieve job results from IBM Quantum {#retrieve-job-results-from-ibm-quantum}"
msgstr "I-retrieve ang mga resulta ng job mula sa IBM Quantum {#retrieve-job-results-from-ibm-quantum}"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "IBM Quantum automatically stores results from every job for you to retrieve at a later date. Use this feature to continue quantum programs across kernel restarts and review past results. You can get the ID of a job programmatically through its `job_id` method, or you can see all your submitted jobs and their IDs on the [Workloads page](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/workloads).\n"
msgstr "Awtomatikong iniimbak ng IBM Quantum ang mga resulta mula sa bawat job para mai-retrieve mo sa ibang pagkakataon. Gamitin ang feature na ito para ituloy ang mga quantum program pagkatapos ng kernel restart at suriin ang mga nakaraang resulta. Makukuha mo ang ID ng isang job nang programatiko sa pamamagitan ng `job_id` method nito, o maaari kang tingnan ang lahat ng iyong mga na-submit na job at ang kanilang mga ID sa [pahina ng Workloads](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/workloads).\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "To find a job programmatically, use the [`QiskitRuntimeService.jobs`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-ibm-runtime/qiskit-runtime-service#jobs) method. By default, this returns the most recently submitted jobs, but you can also filter jobs by backend name, creation date, and more. The following cell finds any jobs submitted in the last three months. The `created_after` argument must be a [`datetime.datetime`](https://docs.python.org/3.8/library/datetime.html#datetime.datetime) object.\n"
msgstr "Para mahanap ang isang job nang programatiko, gamitin ang [`QiskitRuntimeService.jobs`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-ibm-runtime/qiskit-runtime-service#jobs) method. By default, ibinabalik nito ang mga pinakabagong na-submit na job, pero maaari ka ring mag-filter ng mga job ayon sa backend name, petsa ng paglikha, at iba pa. Hinahanap ng sumusunod na cell ang anumang mga job na na-submit sa nakalipas na tatlong buwan. Ang `created_after` na argument ay dapat na isang [`datetime.datetime`](https://docs.python.org/3.8/library/datetime.html#datetime.datetime) na object.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "You can also select by backend, job state, session, and more. For more information, see [`QiskitRuntimeService.jobs`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-ibm-runtime/qiskit-runtime-service#jobs) in the API documentation.\n"
msgstr "Maaari ka ring pumili ayon sa backend, estado ng job, session, at iba pa. Para sa karagdagang impormasyon, tingnan ang [`QiskitRuntimeService.jobs`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-ibm-runtime/qiskit-runtime-service#jobs) sa dokumentasyon ng API.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Once you have the job ID, use the [`QiskitRuntimeService.job`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-ibm-runtime/qiskit-runtime-service#job) method to retrieve it.\n"
msgstr "Kapag mayroon ka nang job ID, gamitin ang [`QiskitRuntimeService.job`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-ibm-runtime/qiskit-runtime-service#job) method para i-retrieve ito.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Save results to disk {#save-results-to-disk}"
msgstr "I-save ang mga resulta sa disk {#save-results-to-disk}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "You may also want to save results to disk. To do this, use Python's built-in JSON library with encoders from `qiskit-ibm-runtime`.\n"
msgstr "Maaari ka ring mag-save ng mga resulta sa disk. Para magawa ito, gamitin ang built-in na JSON library ng Python kasama ang mga encoder mula sa `qiskit-ibm-runtime`.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "You can then load this array from disk in a separate kernel.\n"
msgstr "Maaari mo ring i-load ang array na ito mula sa disk sa isang hiwalay na kernel.\n"
